COOLBOY12 — KIND-DEFINITION SCHEMA (structural contract)

ARTIFACT 069 · KIND-DEFINITION schema · docs/registry/kind_definition.schema · Own: R · RM: R ·
T: schema · R: CONTRACT · SoT: AUTHORITATIVE · Auth: defining · Canon: canonical-about-meaning ·
CD: yes · Ph/St: P3/3b · Req: RR-16 · BP: §9.4 · RMS: §10.1 · H: 068 · S: — · LS: LS-1 · G: — ·
→ all Kind schemas, 074, 075 · Val: definition resolves; versionable; references only declared
