==================================================================================================
9. ROADMAP TRACE — contract-level
==================================================================================================

The statuses below assess this file as a structural contract. They claim no resolver, version
mechanism, validator, declared-status proof or concrete KIND-DEFINITION Record; those belong to
their own rows.

Val  definition resolves          §2 identity-bearing envelope; §5 RESOLUTION — the structure
                                  a resolver needs is required; resolution itself is 115's
Val  versionable                  §5 VERSIONABILITY: 069 defines no version mechanics and does
                                  not obstruct the Registry evolution and versioning
                                  representation rows 108–110 own; §1; P-01B (deferred, not
                                  prohibited)
Val  references only declared     §3 subject_model and subject_kind (one declared Kind of one
     entities (063)               model; declared status an EXTERNAL check); §5 REFERENCES;
                                  P-02
